---
import LandingLayout from '../layouts/LandingLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'July 24, 2026';
---

<LandingLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | DSCRBroker.com"
  description="How DSCRBroker.com collects, uses, and shares the information you submit through our DSCR loan matching service."
>
  <section class="relative py-16 md:py-24 px-4">
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, #131C31 0%, #0B1120 60%);" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <article class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <a href="/" class="text-sm text-blue hover:text-blue-light transition-colors">Back to Home</a>
      <h1 class="mt-6 text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/40">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <div class="legal-body mt-10 space-y-8 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">

        <section>
          <p>
            DSCRBroker.com ("DSCRBroker.com," "we," "us," or "our") operates a lead matching service that connects real estate investors with licensed, third-party DSCR loan brokers. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and the choices you have. By using this website or submitting a form, you agree to this Privacy Policy.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            DSCRBroker.com is not a lender, bank, or mortgage broker. We do not make credit decisions, approve loans, set loan terms, or fund mortgages.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>When you use our matching form or contact us, we may collect:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Contact information</strong> you provide: name, email address, and phone number.</li>
            <li><strong>Deal information</strong> you provide: property state, property type, estimated value, down payment, loan goal, credit range, timeline, citizenship status, and related details you enter into the form.</li>
            <li><strong>Technical and usage information</strong> collected automatically: IP address, device type, browser, pages viewed, referring source, and the marketing parameters (such as UTM tags) attached to your visit.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We do not collect your Social Security number, and submitting the form does not pull your credit. Any credit check is performed later by the matched licensed broker, at the application stage, with your consent.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>To match you with a licensed DSCR loan broker in your state and route your inquiry to them.</li>
            <li>To respond to your questions and communicate with you about your request.</li>
            <li>To operate, secure, measure, and improve our website and service.</li>
            <li>To comply with legal obligations and enforce our terms.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>How We Share Your Information</h2>
          <p>We share the information you submit with:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>The matched licensed broker</strong> and their wholesale lending partners, so they can contact you and evaluate your scenario. This is the core purpose of the service.</li>
            <li><strong>Service providers</strong> that help us operate the website and process form submissions (for example, hosting, analytics, and CRM/webhook providers), bound by confidentiality obligations.</li>
            <li><strong>Authorities or other parties</strong> when required by law, to protect our rights, or in connection with a business transfer.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">We do not sell your information to unrelated third parties for their own independent marketing.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Consent to Be Contacted (TCPA)</h2>
          <p>
            By submitting the form and checking the consent box, you authorize DSCRBroker.com and the matched broker to contact you at the phone number and email you provided, including by autodialed or prerecorded calls and text messages, about your DSCR loan inquiry. Consent is not a condition of any purchase. Message and data rates may apply. You can opt out at any time by replying STOP to a text, asking to be removed on a call, or contacting us at the email below.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Cookies and Analytics</h2>
          <p>
            We use cookies and similar technologies, including Google Analytics, to understand how visitors use the site and to measure our marketing. You can control cookies through your browser settings. For information on how Google uses data, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google's policy</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Your Choices and Rights</h2>
          <p>
            You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of the personal information you submitted by contacting us at the email below. Depending on where you live, you may have additional rights under laws such as the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA). We will honor verified requests as required by applicable law. You can opt out of marketing communications at any time.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Data Retention and Security</h2>
          <p>
            We retain the information you submit for as long as needed to provide the matching service, comply with legal obligations, and resolve disputes. We use reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your information. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p>This service is for adults and is not directed to anyone under 18. We do not knowingly collect information from children.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top reflects the latest version. Continued use of the site after changes means you accept the updated policy.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Contact Us</h2>
          <p>Questions about this Privacy Policy or your information? Email us at <a href="mailto:privacy@dscrbroker.com">privacy@dscrbroker.com</a>.</p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <style>
    .legal-body h2 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    .legal-body p { font-size: 0.9375rem; }
    .legal-body ul {
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
      padding-left: 1.25rem;
      list-style: disc;
    }
    .legal-body li { font-size: 0.9375rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
    .legal-body a { color: #3B82F6; text-decoration: underline; }
    .legal-body a:hover { color: #60A5FA; }
    .legal-body strong { color: #E2E8F0; font-weight: 600; }
  </style>
</LandingLayout>
